        <UserObject label="" mermaidData="{&#xa;  &quot;data&quot;: &quot;flowchart TD\n    %% Main Entry\n    Start([Public Homepage]) --&gt; Action{What does the&lt;br&gt;user want to do?}\n\n    %% ==========================================\n    %% BRANCH 1 &amp; 2: BROWSE AND APPLY (THE TENANT)\n    %% ==========================================\n    Action --&gt;|Search Apartments| Browse1(Filter by Price/Location)\n    Browse1 --&gt; Browse2(Query PostgreSQL: isPubliclyListed = true)\n    Browse2 --&gt; Browse3(View Unit Details &amp; Photos)\n    \n    Browse3 --&gt; ApplyDecision{Apply for&lt;br&gt;this unit?}\n    ApplyDecision --&gt;|No| Browse1\n    ApplyDecision --&gt;|Yes| CheckAuth1{Is User&lt;br&gt;Logged In?}\n    \n    CheckAuth1 --&gt;|No| TLogin(Register / Login as Tenant) --&gt; ApplyForm\n    CheckAuth1 --&gt;|Yes| ApplyForm(Fill out Booking Application)\n    \n    ApplyForm --&gt; SaveApp[(Save Application to PostgreSQL)]\n    SaveApp --&gt; Notify(Notify the Unit&#39;s Landlord)\n    Notify --&gt; SuccessMessage(Display Success Message)\n    SuccessMessage --&gt; Start\n\n    %% ==========================================\n    %% BRANCH 3: EXTERNAL LANDLORD (MANUAL POSTING)\n    %% ==========================================\n    Action --&gt;|Post an Ad| CheckAuth2{Is Landlord&lt;br&gt;Logged In?}\n    \n    CheckAuth2 --&gt;|No| LLogin(Register / Login as Landlord) --&gt; ExtDash\n    CheckAuth2 --&gt;|Yes| ExtDash{External Landlord&lt;br&gt;Dashboard}\n    \n    ExtDash --&gt;|Manage Apps| ViewApps(View Submitted Tenant Applications)\n    ViewApps --&gt; AppDecision{Approve or Reject?}\n    AppDecision --&gt;|Reject| RejectMsg(Notify Tenant) --&gt; ExtDash\n    AppDecision --&gt;|Approve| ApproveMsg(Notify Tenant &amp; Share Contact Info)\n    ApproveMsg --&gt; Delist(Update Unit isPubliclyListed = false)\n    Delist --&gt; ExtDash\n\n    ExtDash --&gt;|Create Ad| Post1(Enter Unit Details &amp; Upload Photos)\n    Post1 --&gt; Post2(Set Price &amp; Description)\n    Post2 --&gt; Post3[(Save to PostgreSQL:&lt;br&gt;isPubliclyListed = true)]\n    Post3 --&gt; ExtDash&quot;,&#xa;  &quot;config&quot;: null&#xa;}" id="XTu2iLV9iUBEKEMj6g0m-1">
